OL,3,GNEWSACrew in Lewis fishing boat tragedy
OL,4,Anamed by police
OL,5,
OL,6,FA fisherman whose body was found after
OL,7,Fa boat went missing off the Western
OL,8,FIsles on Tuesday has been named as
OL,9,FDouglas Craigie.
OL,11,FThe 49-year-old's crew-mates, Norman
OL,12,FMurray, who is 40 and known as Tam, and
OL,13,F23-year-old Murdo Morrison are still
OL,14,Fmissing.
OL,16,FThe three men, who are all from Lewis,
OL,17,Fhad been fishing in a boat called
OL,18,FKilda.
OL,20,FThe vessel went missing off Port of
OL,21,FNess in north Lewis.
OL,23,APub: 15-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
